            <div xml:id="d388">

                <pb facs="0355" n="345" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg345"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/6–349: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Taipei</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Edgar</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-06-03T17:00:00-04:00">June 3, 1949—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>118. Dept is reopening in NSC question substantial ECA assistance to Taiwan.
                    Decision expected within 2 weeks. For ur conf info and discreet transmission
                    Craig and Griffin respectively activation industrial reconstruction program or
                    other massive economic aid appears improbable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
